    "intro_html":  "This is the potluck casserole that always disappears first. Spanish rice built from scratch instead of a box, turkey and spinach folded into a sour cream and green chile base, corn chips crushed across the top for crunch. Each serving lands at {{cal}} calories with \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The chips on top are not a garnish. They are the entire reason people go back for seconds.",
